Begin3
Title:          ImgEdit
Description:    A simple pixel editor mostly for creating graphics for the Danger Engine.
Summary:        A simple pixel editor mostly for creating graphics for the Danger Engine. It has limited support for non-native graphics formats like BMP. At present, some options (like image size) can only be set from the command-line. Also, includes IMGVIEW simple viewer. Requires 386+, VGA and MOUSE. (UPX Compressed)
Keywords:       dos, game, images, sprites, igg, igs, bmp, development, dev
End
